        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Cancer &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>Heaven's Dragon Wave &mdash; the march of the spirits, the road to Yomotsu Hirasaka fully open.</em></p><p>Each creature in the cone must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> Half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> @Damage[8d8[void]] damage, and it is dragged 30 feet toward the mouth.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and if the creature is at half Hit Points or fewer <strong>it dies</strong>, its soul carried away.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
